WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Who is shaping this decision? Map influence without turning evidence into accusation.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Map money, access and ownership.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Separate evidence from inference.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Remove weak links.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep prohibited conclusions visible.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A power map is not a verdict.
